    "body": "Another one that came to my mind from https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10521, which is more a direct consequence of not reloading the iframes anymore: in [update the rendering](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#update-the-rendering) the list of documents that share the same container document are supposed to be in tree order.  Currently that order can't change during this task, with atomic moves, it could be changed anywhere during the task.\r\n\r\nIt seems that the current implementation in Chrome (weirdly) ignores the move even outside of the task: https://jsfiddle.net/vr7f958d/",
